background=f'''<section class="page-intro shell">{eyebrow('BACKGROUND / EDUCATION & TECHNICAL WORK')}<h1>A change of field.<br><em>A consistent curiosity.</em></h1><p class="lead">My technical story is built mainly on independent engineering and academic research. I keep that separate from paid employment.</p></section><section class="shell background-layout"><div class="section-index">EDUCATION</div><div class="timeline"><article><span>MSc / IN PROGRESS</span><h2>Data Science, AI &<br>Digital Business</h2><p>Gisma University of Applied Sciences · Germany</p><p class="muted">Dissertation: aggregate hourly cart and order forecasting from OTTO event logs.</p></article><article><span>BTech</span><h2>Electronics &<br>Communication Engineering</h2><p>Sri Venkateswara College of Engineering · Tirupati, India</p></article></div><div class="section-index">TECHNICAL WORK</div><div class="timeline"><article><span>INDEPENDENT ENGINEERING</span><h2>Data, ML and delivery projects</h2><p>REES46 V2 and FulfillAI are self-directed engineering projects. OTTO is MSc research. The case studies link to the implementation, measured results and lab records.</p>{link('/projects/','Explore the work','text-link')}</article></div><div class="section-index">TRAINING</div><div class="timeline"><article><span>SELF-DIRECTED LEARNING</span><h2>Python training · IntrnForte</h2><p>A Python self-learning / training experience. I describe it as learning, rather than employer-supervised engineering work.</p></article></div></section>{contact_band()}'''
